title: Plumbing
text: Hot and cold must both run through the mixer pipe. Where the pipes cross, one has to go under.
trick: red and blue enter the mixer pipe from opposite ends, so each flows back out through the other's pipes and the whole system runs magenta; a teleporter pair takes the hot pipe under the cold riser
motif: plumbing: a cold riser, a hot supply, a mixer pipe with a tap in the middle and a gauge where hot crosses cold, joints left open for elbows
ink: 4
expect: merges>=1, reversals>=1
